3 I. The state treasurer shall establish a separate nonlapsing account within the fish and
4 game fund to be known as the nongame species account to which moneys obtained by the fish and
5 game department shall be applied, including any federal moneys which become available from the
6 federal government, any state funds appropriated, and all donations received. The state treasurer
7 shall invest funds received specifically for deposit in the nongame species account as
8 provided by law, and any interest received on such investments shall be credited to the
9 nongame species account. The moneys in this account shall be used for the development and
10 implementationofacomprehensivenongamespeciesmanagementprogram.
